@startuml Linkwise_Chat_BDD
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Latin Modern Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #2A9D8F
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 28
title SysML-style bdd: global agent messaging system (proposed)
class "Global messaging system" as Network <<block>>
class "Linkwise station" as Station <<block>>
class "Agent host" as Agent <<block>>
class "Messaging service" as Messaging <<block>>
class "Station execution service" as Execution <<block>>
class "HF transceiver + antenna" as RF <<block>>
class "Durable message store" as Store <<block>>
class "Modem backend" as Modem <<block>>
Network "1" o-- "2..*" Station
Station "1" *-- "1" Messaging
Station "1" *-- "1" Execution
Station "1" *-- "1" Store
Station "1" o-- "1..*" Agent
Station "1" o-- "1" RF
Execution "1" o-- "1" Modem
Messaging --> Store : persist envelopes / receipts
Messaging --> Execution : request bounded contacts
Agent --> Messaging : local authenticated MCP
note bottom of Network
Stations have independent administration and station
authority.
Global scope does not imply continuous or universal
RF reachability.
Agent instances and stations have different
identities and lifetimes.
end note
@enduml
